{"title":"Glimmerfox","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 41 Moonbeast that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (0.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonhart-antler\">Moonhart Antler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>212</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>197</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>9</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=41\" title=\"Pick level 41\"><td><b>41</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>212</td><td>in the wilds around 1675, 1642</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>197</td><td>in the wilds around 1672, 1641</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>9</td><td>in the wilds around 1694, 1561</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-hide\" title=\"Silver Hide - in 100% of 3 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 3/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"glimmerfox-pelt\" title=\"Glimmerfox Pelt - in 67% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/03a19913fc54d1b9159e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 2/3</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"glimmerfox-pelt\" title=\"Glimmerfox Pelt - in 67% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 4 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/03a19913fc54d1b9159e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 2/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"silver-hide\" title=\"Silver Hide - in 100% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 3/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 33% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 1/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"ogrewax-torso\" title=\"Ogrewax Torso (mage x1) - in 33% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b8462ae309e7613f97c6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 1/3</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-267.5px,-1332.3px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1280px\"><i style=\"left:334.3px;top:1343.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:336.3px;top:1318.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:255.2px;top:1364.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:346.5px;top:1370.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:248.4px;top:1312.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:234.2px;top:1369.1px\"></i>